 Returns `(T₀, Vₗ, Vᵥ)` where `T₀` is the saturation Temperature (in `[K]`), `Vₗ` is the liquid saturation volume (in `[m³]`) and `Vᵥ` is the vapour saturation volume (in `[m³]`).
 
